<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>It Feels So Good</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Sonique</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Hear My Cry</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4Y8q64VnhD0vFYy9g2WFpi</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.275" end="00:08.790">You always make me smile when I'm feeling down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.790" end="00:16.216">You give me such a vibe, it's totally bonafide, mm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.216" end="00:23.664">It's not the way you walk and it ain't the way you talk</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.664" end="00:29.468">It ain't the job you got, that keeps me satisfied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.468" end="00:37.053">(Your love, it feels so good) And that's what takes me high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.053" end="00:44.113">(Higher than I've been before) Your love, it keeps me alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.113" end="00:52.026">(Thought I should let you know) That your touch, it means so much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.026" end="01:00.026">(When I'm alone at night) It's you I'm always thinking of, ooh, oh, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.688" end="01:08.688">Your love, it feels so good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.494" end="01:23.504">Ooh, I want you to understand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.504" end="01:30.509">Oh-ho, you make me feel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.509" end="01:38.509">What I need to feel, yes, in my heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.424" end="01:45.253">Ooh, I want you to understand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.253" end="01:53.241">How I feel, yeah, deep inside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.241" end="02:00.738">Oh-ho, you make me feel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.738" end="02:07.324">What I need to feel, yes, in my heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.324" end="02:14.315">(Your love, it feels so good) And that's what takes me high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.315" end="02:22.037">(Higher than I've been before) Your love, it keeps me alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.037" end="02:29.388">(Thought I should let you know) That your touch, it means so much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.388" end="02:33.388">(When I'm alone at night) It's you I'm always thinking of, ooh, oh, baby</p></div></body></tt>